{"created": "2026-09-14T14:17:34.727076+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-14T14:17:35.104999+00:00", "id": 22751568, "conceptrecid": "22751567", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22751568", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22751567", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22751568", "metadata": {"title": "Nonattainment of the p-Jordan exponent in locally finite triangular groups", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22751568", "publication_date": "2026-09-14", "description": "<p>For every prime \\(p\\), we construct a countable locally finite triangular group \\(\\Gamma\\leq\\operatorname{GL}_2(\\overline{\\mathbb F}_p)\\) of derived length two whose admissible \\(p\\)-Jordan exponents are exactly \\[\\{s\\in\\mathbb R:\\exists J&gt;0\\ \\forall H\\leq\\Gamma\\text{ finite},\\ j_p(H)\\leq J|H|_p^s\\}=(1,\\infty).\\] Here \\(j_p(H)\\) is the least index of a normal abelian \\(p^{\\prime}\\)-subgroup and \\(|H|_p\\) is the \\(p\\)-part of \\(|H|\\). Thus the exponent is one and is not attained, answering Kourovka Problem 21.121(a). The construction uses the exact multiplicative orders of divisors of \\(\\Phi_{k!}(p)\\) and the limit \\(\\varphi(k!)/k!\\to0\\).</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Jayadevan, Achyuth", "affiliation": "Manipal Institute of Technology, MAHE", "orcid": "0009-0008-8745-4078"}], "version": "1.0.0", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/Achxy/kourovka-llm-langgraph-benchmarks", "code:developmentStatus": {"id": "active", "title": {"en": "Active"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22751567"}}]}}, "title": "Nonattainment of the p-Jordan exponent in locally finite triangular groups", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22751568", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22751568", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22751568?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22751568", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22751568", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22751568", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22751568/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22751567", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22751567", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22751567", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22751567", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22751568/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22751568/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22751568/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22751568/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22751568:kourovka-21-121a-paper.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22751568:kourovka-21-121a-paper.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22751568:kourovka-21-121a-paper.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22751568:kourovka-21-121a-paper.pdf/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg", "750": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22751568:kourovka-21-121a-paper.pdf/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg", "1200": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22751568:kourovka-21-121a-paper.pdf/full/%5E1200,/0/default.jpg"}, "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22751568/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22751568/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22751568/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22751568/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22751568/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22751568/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22751568/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22751568/access/grants", "